      {
        "id": "u1",
        "kind": "CONCEPT",
        "label": "Définition et principe général du raffinage en phase vapeur",
        "attributes": {
          "depth": "explanation"
        },
        "subtopic_ids": [
          "s1"
        ],
        "rationale": "Explains the definition and mechanism of vapour phase refining: formation of a volatile compound from impure metal, separation from impurities, and thermal decomposition to yield pure metal.",
        "review_flags": [],
        "contextualization": {
          "value": "none",
          "evidence": []
        },
        "passages": [
          {
            "id": "p1",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Le **raffinage en phase vapeur** est une méthode utilisée pour purifier certains métaux. Elle repose sur l’idée suivante : on transforme le métal impur en un **composé volatil** (qui peut facilement passer à l’état gazeux), puis on décompose ce gaz pour récupérer le métal très pur.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 282
          },
          {
            "id": "p2",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "heading"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "## Principe général",
            "start": 284,
            "end": 303
          },
          {
            "id": "p3",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "1. **Le métal impur réagit avec un gaz ou une substance chimique**  ",
            "start": 305,
            "end": 373
          },
          {
            "id": "p4",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   Il forme un composé volatil.",
            "start": 374,
            "end": 405
          },
          {
            "id": "p5",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "2. **Le composé est séparé des impuretés**  ",
            "start": 407,
            "end": 451
          },
          {
            "id": "p6",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   Les impuretés ne forment généralement pas de vapeur avec ce réactif et restent donc dans le récipient.",
            "start": 452,
            "end": 557
          },
          {
            "id": "p7",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "3. **Le composé volatil est chauffé ou décomposé**  ",
            "start": 559,
            "end": 611
          },
          {
            "id": "p8",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "   Il redonne le métal pur, qui se dépose sur une surface.",
            "start": 612,
            "end": 670
          },
          {
            "id": "p9",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "On peut résumer ainsi :",
            "start": 672,
            "end": 695
          },
          {
            "id": "p10",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "\\[",
            "start": 697,
            "end": 699
          },
          {
            "id": "p11",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "\\text{Métal impur} \\rightarrow \\text{composé volatil} \\rightarrow \\text{métal pur}",
            "start": 700,
            "end": 782
          },
          {
            "id": "p12",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
