            "text": "## Exemple : raffinage du nickel (procédé Mond)",
            "start": 787,
            "end": 834
          },
          {
            "id": "p14",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Le nickel impur réagit avec du monoxyde de carbone, CO, à environ 50–60 °C :",
            "start": 836,
            "end": 912
          },
          {
            "id": "p15",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "\\[",
            "start": 914,
            "end": 916
          },
          {
            "id": "p16",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "\\text{Ni} + 4\\text{CO} \\rightarrow \\text{Ni(CO)}_4",
            "start": 917,
            "end": 967
          },
          {
            "id": "p17",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "\\]",
            "start": 968,
            "end": 970
          },
          {
            "id": "p18",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "On obtient du **tétracarbonyle de nickel**, un gaz volatil.",
            "start": 972,
            "end": 1031
          },
          {
            "id": "p19",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Ensuite, ce gaz est chauffé vers 180–200 °C. Il se décompose alors :",
            "start": 1033,
            "end": 1101
          },
          {
            "id": "p20",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "\\[",
            "start": 1103,
            "end": 1105
          },
          {
            "id": "p21",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "\\text{Ni(CO)}_4 \\rightarrow \\text{Ni pur} + 4\\text{CO}",
            "start": 1106,
            "end": 1160
          },
          {
            "id": "p22",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "\\]",
            "start": 1161,
            "end": 1163
          },
          {
            "id": "p23",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Le nickel pur se dépose, tandis que le monoxyde de carbone peut être réutilisé.",
            "start": 1165,
            "end": 1244
          }
        ],
